SUMMARY:Launch Party: Danu Social House becoming community-worker owned -
  by Danu Social House
LOCATION:Danu Social House
DESCRIPTION:More info: https://www.instagram.com/p/Dd87yR4y_IV/\n\nHosted
  by Danu Social House (https://www.danusocialhouse.ca)\n\nCome celebrate
  Danu becoming a community-worker owned cooperative! Sign up for a
  membership and stay for a night of drinks\, chats\, and many toasts to
  democratic ownership. Meet the workers\, the board\, and the community
  who have created this wonderful thing.
END:VEVENT
