SUMMARY:Book Launch: Mobilizing Data for Justice - by Another Story
  Bookshop
LOCATION:Another Story Bookshop
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.com/e/mobilizing-data-for-justice-toronto-launch-t
 ickets-1999719729542\n\nHosted by Another Story Bookshop
  (https://anotherstory.ca/home)\n\nJoin for a conversation between authors
  Chris Hurl and Kevin Walby\, and speakers Eric Mykhalovcskiy and Lesley
  Wood. Drawing on interviews with more than fifty data activists around
  the world\, Mobilizing Data for Justice provides the inspiration that
  activists need for social justice struggles today.
END:VEVENT
