SUMMARY:Benefit Concert for Gaza: a night for Mutual Aid and New Beginnings
  - by Ash & Anseh
LOCATION:Typist Studios
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/benefit-concert-for-gaza-a-night-for-mutual-a
 id-and-new-beginnings-tickets-2001686695791\n\nHosted by Ash & Anseh
  ()\n\nAn incredible evening of live music\, art auction and more!
  Featuring local hip-hop artist Cee Reality\, Egyptian-Canadian
  singer-songwriter Yehia\, Natalie Fasheh\, and Nepali-Canadian
  scholar-activist-artist-poet\, Yogendra Skakya (Shakti Blues). All
  proceeds go to supporting emergency evacuation from Gaza and Direct
  Mutual Aid for families on the ground.
END:VEVENT
