  experience isn’t about distance or pace\, but about intention\, breath\
 , and awareness as we move together with care.\nLed by Karina Vee\, guests
  are invited to tune into their breath\, notice the rhythm of their steps\
 , and move as a form of meditation. The walk closes with a grounding momen
 t of gratitude\, encouraging you to carry that sense of self-love and comp
 assion with you long after the walk ends.\nAll are welcome — whether thi
 s…\n\nHosted by ALO
