DESCRIPTION:Address:\nQueens Park\nMeet us at the Monument Statute at the 
 centre of the park!\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nIt's been awhile.. let's expl
 ore\, photograph and bond over our love for street photography by Queen's 
 Park and the surrounding neighbourhood!\nUpon a Stroll is a guided photo w
 alk series rooted in community\, creativity\, and the beauty of everyday l
 ife. Through documentary-style photography and portraiture\, participants 
 will explore Toronto’s neighbourhoods with intention\, capturing moments
 \, making connections\, and sharing in the joy of storytelling through ima
 ges.\nWhether you shoot on film or digital\, our walk encourages participa
 nts to reframe their surroundings and capture the beauty in what…\n\nHos
 ted by Upon a Stroll & Nautica Simone
LOCATION:Queens Park\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
