 e & Technology Studies ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/19TqNOwPSR
 qLDATAHoljlg )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nYork’s Sci
 ence & Technology Studies (STS) Graduate Program is the first English–sp
 eaking STS program in Canada offering advanced training leading to both MA
