 ons across traditional disciplinary boundaries as they examine and analyze
  the role of science\, technology\, and innovation in our societies\, cult
 ures\, and economies. An MA or PhD degree in STS from York is extremely ve
 rsatile and is a fitting background for careers that require insight into 
 the complexities of scientific and technological societies and economies (
 e.g. policy\, law\, business\, academia\, charities\, etc.)\nLearn more ab
 out our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( 
