DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Creati
 ve Writing ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/tan7xCFZQRuXf3Ri2yOMxw
  )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nYou might not know this\
 , but the Graduate Program in English is home to a unique Graduate Diploma
  in Creative Writing open to all graduate students\, regardless of faculty
  affiliation or area of study.\nFocused on developing students’ writing 
 skills\, the Diploma includes workshop-based courses in poetry\, fiction a
 nd creative nonfiction\, and a Capstone Project completed under direct sup
 ervision from York Creative Writing faculty and established professional w
 riters.\nYou also needn’t enroll in the Diploma to apply to our poetry o
 r prose workshops. These seminar-based courses afford students opportuniti
 es to supplement their academic work with creative practices\, learn about
  literary culture\, gain insight into the publishing industry\, or simply 
 experiment with language and storytelling in a supportive\, encouraging\, 
 intellectually rigorous atmosphere.\nLearn more about our graduate program
 s at futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yo
 rku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply
 @yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https://y
