CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Progra
 ms),Graduate Program in Interdisciplinary Studies
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260929
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Interd
 isciplinary Studies ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/6-7Ps31kTDKL3
 kv2QSetTA )? We invite you to attend our program session!\nThe YorkU MA in
  Interdisciplinary Studies—one of the first formalized graduate programs
  in Canada—enables highly motivated students to study within three disti
 nct disciplines in order to deeply explore a particular problem or phenome
 non. Established in 1972\, the IS Graduate Programme encourages students t
 o pursue original research in ways that do not fit comfortably into method
 ological and theoretical categories represented by and propagated in conve
 ntional MA programs. Interdisciplinarians evaluate multiple theories and m
 ethods and utilize the best elements from a variety of disciplines to gene
 rate cutting-edge work. IS students interact with a community of scholars 
 who have insight into specialized topics in order to address complex probl
 ems and questions that cannot be tackled satisfactorily based on research 
 in one discipline.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestuden
 ts.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/p
 rograms )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( http:
 //futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs ).\nRegistration Required ( ht
 tps://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/6-7Ps31kTDKL3kv2QSetTA ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
ORGANIZER;CN="Faculty of Graduate Studies":MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/interdisciplinary-studies-ma/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
