DESCRIPTION:Peer-Assisted Study Session (PASS) Leader: Mihn\nThis Peer-ass
 isted Study Session (PASS) is for : ECON 1000: Introduction to Microeconom
 ics\nParticipate in weekly\, collaborative study sessions led by a peer wh
 o has successfully completed the course. Review key concepts\, ask questio
 ns and discover effective strategies to boost your confidence and academic
  success.\nPlease Note: Any schedule changes or session cancellations will
  be communicated through eClass. Students are encouraged to check eClass r
 egularly for the most up-to-date information. During Fall Reading Week\, P
 eer-Assisted Study Sessions\, Tutoring\, and Office Hours are typically no
 t offered. If a session is scheduled during this period\, details will be 
 communicated by the course instructor and posted in eClass.\nLearn more ab
 out PASS ( https://students.yorku.ca/PASS ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008
LOCATION:MK 2040\, Markham Campus
ORGANIZER;CN="Markham Campus Peer-Assisted Study Sessions":MAILTO:
