DESCRIPTION:In this session\, Vice-Provost and Dean Alice MacLachan will w
 alk you through some essential steps for your graduate studies application
 s.\nJoin us ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_7WJysQSXR_iZaThdK_
 aJDw ) to learn more about: – how to write a statement of interest – c
 hoosing a graduate program – finding and approaching potential research 
 supervisors – other tips and tricks for putting your best foot forward i
 n your graduate studies application.\nThis session ( https://yorku.zoom.us
 /webinar/register/WN_7WJysQSXR_iZaThdK_aJDw ) is happening as part of Expe
 rience Grad York. To find other sessions covering graduate admissions at Y
 ork\, please visit https://www.yorku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ( https://www.yor
 ku.ca/gradstudies/egy/ ).\nIf you have any accessibility requirements for 
 this event\, please let us know at fgsapply@yorku.ca.\nRegistration is req
 uired ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_7WJysQSXR_iZaThdK_aJDw )
 .\n
