DESCRIPTION:Strawberry Matcha Event\nOne day\, two chances\, fifty cups each. On October 14th we’re running a Strawberry Matcha special at our Union Station location for $3.99. Once the cups are gone\, they’re gone. \nSessions:\n10:00–11:00 AM\n2:00–3:00 PM \n500ml per cup. Max 50 cups per session. Each session ends after one hour or when 50 cups are sold\, whichever comes first. \nUnion Station only. Cannot be combined with any other promo\, coupon\, or discount. Please queue neatly in single file and may the odds be in your favor.
