SUMMARY:Film/Cinema & Media Studies (MA\, MFA\, PhD)
DTSTART:20261014T160000Z
DTEND:20261014T170000Z
DTSTAMP:20260923T174200Z
UID:MEC-253491938bb22e1044113ffca7e322ee@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261014T160000Z
SEQUENCE:2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/0
 9/FGS_Banner_1-7-1.png
CATEGORIES:Faculty of Graduate Studies,Faculty of Graduate Studies (Progra
 ms),Graduate Program in Cinema &amp\; Media Studies,Graduate Program in Fi
 lm
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260923
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Cinema
  & Media Studies\, or Film? We invite you to attend our program session!\n
 York University’s Graduate Program in Cinema and Media Studies is recogn
 ized internationally as one of Canada’s most innovative and dynamic film
  programs. Students are provided with a unique integration of cinema and m
 edia studies\, hands-on skills\, critical theory\, and state-of-the-art pr
 oduction resources and pedagogy. The program offers three specializations:
  Cinema & Cultural Theory\; National & Transnational Cinemas\; Cinema & Te
 chnologies of the Image. Combined MA/MBA also available.\nCanada’s only 
 dedicated MFA program in Screenwriting trains students in all aspects of w
 riting for the screen\, including television and cinema. Award-winning fil
 mmakers teach in the Production program\, with access to extensive product
 ion facilities and state-of-the-art equipment. You’ll be closely connect
 ed to Toronto’s vibrant film scene\, with research centres like the Toro
 nto International Film Festival Group Film Reference Library and productio
 n companies that provide opportunities and connections to help launch care
 ers. Combined MFA/MBA available.\nLearn more about our graduate programs a
 t futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku
 .ca/graduate/programs )\nStill have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yo
 rku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.ca ).\nRegistration Required ( https://york
 u.zoom.us/meeting/register/6ga1L_aSTQKM-eE0c_mXTw )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923
LOCATION:(URL will be provided in the email confirmation)
