DESCRIPTION:Address:\nNew Stadium\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nWelcome back to
  New Stadium in Toronto for the second edition of ARTIFACTS.\nAbout ARTIFA
 CTS\nARTIFACTS is a recurring show & tell event for tech gadgets of the pa
 st. You’re invited to bring a vintage device\, share what it got right\,
  what it got wrong\, and what it predicted about the future.\nYou are invi
 ted to dig up your old iPod\, Gameboy\, your first phone\, an old MP3 play
 er\, a Zune\, or any other vintage device that you once loved but maybe fo
 rgot about\, and share what it means to you. The more niche\, the better. 
 If you don’t have a device\, you’re also welcome to come\, learn\, and
  experience…\n\nHosted by Michael Mofina & New
