CREATED:20260923
DESCRIPTION:Are you thinking of pursuing your graduate education in Visual
  Arts ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/a2aBdavhRoqDOygNdnK6nw )? W
 e invite you to attend our program session!\nAt York\, the Visual Arts MFA
  / PhD programs are supported by a vibrant university culture that promote
 s a creative dialogue between the disciplines. This dialogue is sustained 
 by an emphasis on team teaching approaches and faculty support for diverge
 nt views\, which is reflected in the diversity of the art practices of our
  students. Currently\, our programs consist of a dynamic community of twen
 ty-five students working in one or more of the following media: video\, pe
 rformance\, painting\, drawing\, printmaking\, sculpture and digital media
 .\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futurestudents.yorku.ca/gradu
 ate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs )\nStill 
 have questions? Contact us at fgsapply@yorku.ca ( mailto:fgsapply@yorku.
 ca ).\nRegistration Required. ( https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/register/a2a
 BdavhRoqDOygNdnK6nw )\n
