UID:6aa5adf4ca248a002915606e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get your spook on with our scary movie screening of\nThe Fly\n
 (1986)\, directed by David Cronenberg.\nA cult classic from a Canadian dir
 ector (and shot in Toronto!)\,\nThe Fly\nis a sci-fi body-horror film abou
 t an eccentric scientist and an experiment gone horribly wrong.\nThe Fly\n
 has a running time of 1 hour and 36 minutes\, and is rated R.\nThere will
  be a short introduction to the film followed by the screening\, which wil
 l be accompanied by closed captions.\nThe next Screen Scaries will be:\nNo
 vember 23\, 2026:\nSuspiria\n(1977) Dario Argento. Runtime: 1h32m\; Ratin
 g: 18A\nDecember 28\, 2026:\nBlack Christmas\n(1974\, USA) Bob Clark. Ru
 ntime: 1h37m\; Rating: R\nJanuary 25\, 2027:\nRing\n(1998\, Japan) Hideo N
 akata. Runtime: 1h35m\; Rating: PG
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, B/C
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa5adf4ca248a002915606e
