UID:6abc00860f56a0002cd4d005@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For people who are new to cell phones and want a basic underst
 anding of how to use them. No previous experience is required. In this cou
 rse we will look at:\n-The parts of a cell phone\n-Safety tips for using y
 our phone\n-Skills such as turning off your ringtone\, taking a picture\, 
 sending a text\, and downloading an app\nResource handout provided.\n[90 m
 in]
LOCATION:Don Mills\, Youth Hub at Lower Level
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abc00860f56a0002cd4d005
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
