 els\, Workshops & Master Classes\, Song Reviews\, Demonstrations and more.
  Hosting industry experts in an environment where music-makers can network
 \, interact and learn with each other face-to-face\, this annual one-day e
 vent is not to be missed. IMSTA FESTA is a FREE event open to everyone in 
 the music making community!\nRegister for IMSTA FESTA and each Master Clas
 s separately in order to reserve your spot.\nAdmission is FREE with REGIST
 RATION.\nDate: Saturday\, October 17\, 2026\nTime: 11:00 a.m. – 6:00 p.m
 .\nLocation: Accolade East Building ( https://maps.app.goo.gl/CtWT2wE9W39z
