X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Toronto 20S To 50S Singles Social": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto-20s-to-50s-singles-social/events/316645548/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_toronto_20s_to_50s_singles_social
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto 20s-50s Singles Social
UID:event_316645548@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053428Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261017T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261017T210000
SUMMARY:Meet New People\, Great Conversations & 50+ Board Games | 25–45 
 | Fast Friends 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nEver wish there w
 ere an easier way to turn a room full of strangers into people you actuall
 y want to talk to?\n*That’s what Fast Friends is designed for.*\n\nInste
 ad of arriving at a busy pub and wondering who to approach\, our host guid
 es you through short conversations and rotations\, giving you the chance t
 o meet a variety of people throughout the evening. You get a little struct
 ure to make connecting easier — without making the evening feel forced o
 r formal.\n\nAnd once the hosted rounds finish\, you can keep the evening 
 going. 🎲\nWe’re back at Stout Irish Pub in Cabbagetown — a relaxed 
 Irish pub with food\, drinks and 50+ board games\, giving you plenty of wa
 ys to continue socialising with the people you’ve met.\n\n🎟️ Book E
 arly & Save: [https://toronto17thoct.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toronto17th
 oct.eventbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nAt the Door:
  CAD $20 cash — to host Faye\nBooking ahead helps us plan the right grou
 p size and venue space\, and your ticket confirms your place.\n\n🤝 What
  to Expect\n7:00 PM — Welcome & Drinks\nMeet your host\, Faye\, grab a d
 rink and settle in.\nComing alone? Completely fine. Many guests arrive sol
 o\, and we’ll help you get comfortable and connected from the start.\n7:
 30 PM — Fast Friends\nThis is where the evening gets going.\nYou’ll mo
 ve through a series of short\, guided conversations\, meeting different pe
 ople along the way. Our host keeps the rotations moving\, so you don’t h
 ave to worry about who to approach or what to do next.\nJust show up\, joi
 n the conversation and see who you click with.\n\n✨ Themed Connection Ro
 unds\nThroughout the evening\, we’ll mix in themed rounds and interactiv
 e prompts designed to make connecting easier.\nThey’ll help you discover
  shared interests\, experiences and unexpected things you have in common 
 — taking the conversation beyond the usual small talk.\n\n🎲 8:30 PM o
 nwards — Board Games & Socialising\nOnce the hosted rounds finish\, the 
 evening doesn’t have to.\nStout has 50+ board games available\, making i
 t easy to keep the conversations going. Pick a game with the people you’
 ve met\, grab another drink\, join a group or simply continue chatting.\nY
 ou don’t have to be a serious gamer — the games are simply another eas
 y way to socialise and get to know people.\n\n🍻 Staying Later?\nStout
 ’s current After Dark Special runs from 9–11 PM\, with $7 beers and $7
  highballs\, among other specials.\n\n❤️ Why Come Along?\n✔️ Meet 
 15–25 new people in one evening\n✔️ Guided conversations make meetin
 g people easier\n✔️ Meet different people through rotating conversatio
 ns\n✔️ Interactive themed rounds to spark better conversations\n✔️
  50+ board games available afterwards 🎲\n✔️ Relaxed Irish pub atmos
 phere\n✔️ Reserved space for our group\n✔️ Most guests come solo\n
 ✔️ Plenty of time to keep socialising after the hosted rounds\n✔️ 
 Friendship-focused — not a dating event\n\n👋 Who Is It For?\nAges 25
 –45\nWhether you’ve just moved to Toronto\, have lived here for years\
 , or simply feel like your social circle could use some fresh faces\, you
 ’re welcome.\nYou don’t need to know anyone beforehand or arrive with 
 a group.\nCome by yourself\, bring a friend\, or simply come ready to have
  a few good conversations and see where the evening takes you.\n\n🌍 Abo
 ut Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has been bringing people
  together through professionally hosted social events in 30+ cities worldw
 ide.\nOur goal is simple: make meeting new people easier\, more relaxed an
 d more enjoyable.\nCome for the conversations. Stay for the games. Leave w
 ith new connections. ❤️
