BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Aga Khan Museum": "https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/2026-ihm-gelli-plate-workshop/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:agakhan_museum
SUMMARY:Colour Impressions: Exploring Gelli Plate Monoprinting Workshop
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261018
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
UID:colour-impressions-exploring-gelli-plate-monoprinting-workshop-2026-10
 -18@agakhanmuseum.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://images.agakhanmuseum.org/uploads/2026/09
 /MicrosoftTeams-image-aspect-ratio-1600-1000.jpeg?resize=1584%2C990&gravit
 y
DESCRIPTION:Inspired by the Museum’s collections\, this hands-on worksho
 p explores the foundational elements of Islamic art\, from geometry and pr
 oportion to rhythm and ornament\, with a particular focus on geometric and
  floral motifs.\n\nThrough guided exploration and mindful experimentation 
 with Gel plate monoprinting\, participants will learn techniques such as l
 ayering\, masking\, and texture transfer to create original prints. This r
 elaxed\, process-oriented workshop invites reflection on the interplay bet
 ween colour\, form\, and pattern\, resulting in vibrant\, one-of-a-kind wo
 rks inspired by the timeless beauty of our collections.
LOCATION:Aga Khan Museum\, 77 Wynford Drive\, Toronto\, ON M3C 1K1
URL:https://agakhanmuseum.org/whats-on/2026-ihm-gelli-plate-workshop/
X-SOURCE:Aga Khan Museum
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Beachmetro": "https://beachmetro.com/event/take-the-cold-plunge-challenge-on-world-menopause-day/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:beachmetro
X-SOURCE:Beach Metro Community News
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261018T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261018T233000
DTSTAMP:20261006T213022Z
CREATED:20261006T184455Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261006T213022Z
UID:53758-1792281600-1792366200@beachmetro.com
SUMMARY:Take the Cold Plunge Challenge on World Menopause Day!
DESCRIPTION:Menopause influences 70% of age-related diseases\, yet less than 1% of preclinical aging studies worldwide consider menopause in their research.\nThat’s why Sinai Health Foundation is inviting you to be bold\, get cold and make a difference for women’s health by joining the Cold Plunge Challenge on Sunday\, October 18th. You can plunge on your own at home\, at your local spa or gym\, or join us at Woodbine Beach for a community plunge in Lake Ontario.\nRegistration for the in-person event is $15/person. Fundraising is encouraged to support research that aims to improve care and health outcomes for women\, now and for the future.\nHelp us transform care for women at every stage of life. Register today.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/take-the-cold-plunge-challenge-on-world-menopause-day/
LOCATION:Woodbine Beach\, 1675 Lakeshore Blvd E\, Toronto\, M4L 3W6
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/06144458/BR0214-2026-EventListing_BlogTO_1000px_FINAL.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Sinai Health Foundation":MAILTO:events@sinaihealthfoundation.ca
END:VEVENT
