LOCATION:Centre for Social Innovation (CSI) – 192 Spadina Ave.\, Toronto\
 , ON M5T 2C2\, Canada
DESCRIPTION:Repair Café Toronto is excited to join We Create Our Futures o
 n the final day October 18 from 11 a.m. to 2 p.m.. At our mini Repair Caf
 é\, we will have volunteer fixers helping visitors repair the small appli
 ances they brought in and showing them how to do the repairs themselves fo
 r free. One item per person. First come first served. On-site registration
  is required and it closes at 1:30 p.m. We will be located at Viola Desmon
 d Room in Room 301. We Create Our Futures is a 3-Day Climate\, Culture & A
 rts festival taking place October 16-18 in downtown Toronto. The festival 
 is organized by Centre for Social Innovation to celebrate climate solution
 s through community collaboration and creation. For more information about
  the festival\, please visit the website here.
