DESCRIPTION:📚 What’s your G.O.A.T. book? Let the world know!\nFor Y
 orkU Spirit Day on Oct. 20\, YorkU Libraries want to showcase your grea
 test book of all time — the one that moved you\, inspired you\, or blew 
 your mind.\nSubmit your pick and tell us why it’s your G.O.A.T. 📖💬
