DESCRIPTION:Hillcrest Library has partnered with Bayview Village Associati
 on (BVA) to deliver a speaker series on topics ranging from health and wel
 lness\, emerging technology\, civic engagement\, arts and culture\, and be
 yond.\nThis series is funded through Government of Canada's "New Horizons 
 for Seniors Program".\nHere are our upcoming session topics:\nOctober 19\n
 –\nAdam Bunch on Toronto's Most Absurd Deaths\n*SOLD OUT*\nOctober 26\n
 –\nDr. Peter Newman: Physicians and Author: "In Harms Way"\nRegistration
  required through the Bayview Village Association. Click\nhere\nto registe
 r.
