UID:6aad6cc93dd190003e72e439@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover the art of henna\, decorative designs which are creat
 ed on a person's body\, using a paste of natural organic henna.  Observe a
 nd enjoy the henna application and learn about its history\, recipe and tr
