DESCRIPTION:Ever wonder what your stuffed animal gets up to after the libr
 ary closes? Find out at our Halloween Stuffy Sleepover!\nCome in your pyja
 mas\, bring your favourite stuffed animal\, and join us for spooky stories
  and a Halloween craft. Then leave your stuffy behind for a sleepover at t
 he library!\nReturn the next day to pick up your stuffy and discover what 
 they got up to overnight.\nFor children ages 3 and up\, accompanied by a p
 arent or caregiver.\nDrop in—no registration required.\n*Only stuffed an
 imals will be sleeping over.
LOCATION:Brookbanks\, Lower Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa997f6ca248a0029160219
