DESCRIPTION:The York University Co-op Program provides students with oppor
 tunities for paid\, hands-on learning and valuable industry experience. We
  encourage you to visit the Co-operative Education website to review progr
 am details and confirm that you meet the academic requirements.\nThe sessi
 on will cover several fundamental resume topics to help you prepare for yo
 ur co-op job search including:\n\nResume and cover letter basics\nEmployer
 s’ expectations in a co-op resume and cover letter\nTips for resume form
 at\, content\, and do’s and don’ts that specifically target co-op leve
 l positions.\n\nJoin in Person:\nTuesday\, October 20\n11:00 a.m. – 12:0
 0 p.m.\n1012 Victor Phillip Dahdelah Building\nRegister Here [icon name=
 ”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″]\n \n \n
