DESCRIPTION:Join instructor Tobi Asmoucha from Gallery 44 Centre for Conte
 mporary Photography for a hands-on digital photography workshop and lear
 n how to use the functions of the DSLR camera in Manual Mode. Compose visu
 ally sound images using a variety of approaches. Hear about photography’
