DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCentre for Social Innovation (CSI)\nSuite 101\nToron
 to\, ON\nCanada\n\nCSI\, Doughnut Economics Collective Toronto\, & Kesaco 
 invite you to rediscover the roots of ecological economics.\nWe are excite
 d to present a screening of the newly released documentary\, Econoclast: H
 erman Daly and the Gospel of Growth. Find more information about the film 
 on econoclast.film.\n6pm - Doors open\n6:30pm - Opening Remarks\, David Mi
 ller\, former mayor of Toronto\, Managing Director of the C40 Centre\n6:40
 pm - Econoclast: Herman Daly and the Gospel of Growth\n7:30pm - Beyond the
  screen: reflections & conversations\nEconoclast is a documentary film abo
 ut Herman Daly\, often called the…\n\nHosted by Centre for Social Innova
 tion\, Wynnie Zhao & Fab Barrillot
LOCATION:Centre for Social Innovation (CSI)\, 192 Spadina Ave.\, Toronto\,
  ON M5T 2C2\, Canada
URL:https://luma.com/891qgjzh
X-SOURCE:Luma Toronto Discover
END:VEVENT
