UID:6a84829c60ccaf01c01f0f38@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Come enjoy a relaxing session of acrylic painting.\nParticipan
 ts will learn to harness their inner creativity and paint a beautiful moun
 tain landscape using acrylic paints.\nNo Experience Necessary\, all suppli
 es will be provided.\nPlease be mindful that the program may get messy and
  dress appropriately.\nRegistration required*\nRegistration opens 12:00 no
