BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/career-and-further-education-expo/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:Career and Further Education Expo
DTSTART:20261021T140000Z
DTEND:20261021T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260925T185800Z
UID:MEC-b4866aabd0aa02ee10cfc72af8eb195e@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261021T140000Z
SEQUENCE:3
CATEGORIES:Career Fairs (CCC),Co-op &amp\; Career Centre
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260925
DESCRIPTION:\nWhat could your next chapter look like?\nThe Career & Furthe
 r Education Expo is your chance to explore what comes next after your degr
 ee – whether that means launching your career\, pursuing graduate or pro
 fessional studies or simply discovering new possibilities you haven’t co
 nsidered!\nMeet representatives from a global network of schools in additi
 on to employers looking to hire new graduates. Ask questions and make conn
