 ds-on activity that introduces you to the arts and builds community. You w
 ill receive all the supplies needed to design your own unique cookie while
  having fun connecting with others.​\nFood allergy notice: Please be awa
 re that food will be used in this program.  Certain food ingredients may c
 ause allergic reactions in some people.​\nDrop in. Teens only. Limited s
 paces.\nTickets will be handed out at 3:45 on a first come first serve bas
 is.\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming
  place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are 
 always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a 
 branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
