UID:6a04d40be8af4a2f00724f7b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered what's going on inside a computer? Ever
  wanted to take apart a computer to see? This workshop is your chance! Fre
 e Geek Toronto is a non-profit organization dedicated to getting unwanted 
 computers and electronics back into working condition. During this worksho
 p\, we'll go over what's inside a computer\, how to properly open a deskto
 p\, and safety guidelines for working with electronics.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
