DESCRIPTION:Join us for this engaging five-part\, in-person learning exper
 ience for LA&PS students interested in social work\, health and community-
 based careers. Gain practical insights from experienced professionals into
  topics such as crisis response\, mental health\, housing\, immigration an
 d the justice system. Attend the session(s) that interest you most or atte
 nd all five to earn a Certificate of Completion. \nHosted by the School
  of the School of Social Work Field Education Office\, Community & Legal A
 id Services Program (CLASP)\, and Complex Communities. \nSession 1: Intro
 duction to the Criminal Justice System in Canada  \nWednesday Oct. 21 | 
 1 – 2:30 p.m. \nRegister Today\n
