SUMMARY:Intimate Partner Violence
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261021T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261021T200000
UID:6ac57159a85a2c00337dab6c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Being aware of the various forms Intimate Partner Violence ca
 n take is the first step to get support against these crimes.\nI.P.V. can 
 take the form of:\nPhysical abuse\, criminal harassment\, sexual violence\
 , cyber-crime\, emotional /psychological abuse\, spiritual abuse\, financi
 al abuse\, reproductive coercion\, coercive control.\nIt shouldn't hurt to
  love. Awareness support safer communities.\nPresented by 33 Division Crim
 inal Investigation Bureau.\nNo registration required.
LOCATION:Fairview\, Room 201
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac57159a85a2c00337dab6c
