 p\;PS Students-Undergrad,LA&amp\;PS Vanier College,LA&amp\;PS Writing Cent
 re,LA&amp\;PS Writing Department
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260925
DESCRIPTION:Workshop 3: A Tense Time\nDo you feel tense when you think 
 about time? Then make time this week to come talk about the 13 ways of Loo
 king at Time in English sentences! In this Thursday’s Grammar On!\, you
 ’ll not only learn how to time-travel in your academic essays\, but you
 ’ll also discover that the past and present are both “simple” and 
 “perfect.”\nNo RSVPs. Just click to join!\n
