CREATED:20261008
DESCRIPTION:This six-week online parent group series provides practical to
 ols and strategies to support children’s emotional health and build posi
 tive family relationships. The program is offered virtually over the lunch
  hour\, making it easy to access.\nWe address:\n\nManaging children’s em
 otional and behavioural challenges\;\nAddressing sibling dynamics\;\nSuppo
 rting your parenting team\; and\nUnderstanding and supporting family membe
 rs’ needs and strengths\n\nFamilies can expect evidence-based\, supporti
 ve care in a warm and welcoming group environment.\nEmail yupc@yorku.ca ( 
 mailto:yupc@yorku.ca ) for more information or see here ( https://www.york
 u.ca/health/yupc/wp-content/uploads/sites/441/2026/08/BBFW-flyer-fall-2026
 .png ).\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008
