SUMMARY:Democracy Fitness: Compromise
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T193000
UID:6aa94db03dd190003e720e79@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Develop and exercise the skills you need to be an active parti
 cipant in everyday democracy in this fun\, interactive\n45-minute\nsession
 . Democracy Fitness expands traditional ideas of what democracy is by expl
 oring the skills that help people participate in civic life\, build unders
 tanding and work together.\nIn this session\, we’ll exercise our\nCompro
 mise\nmuscles. In a democracy\, we find solutions together. When we make r
 oom for each other's approaches\, more people can accept the decisions.\nT
 his program is for\nadults. Drops ins are welcome.\nThis program is offere
 d in partnership with Democracy Fitness Global and MASS LBP.\nGenerously s
 upported by McConnell Foundation.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe per
 sonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library 
 under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The i
 nformation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery
  and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information 
 can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981
 \, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:S. Walter Stewart\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa94db03dd190003e720e79
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
