SUMMARY:Read The Runway: Anna Sui S/S '94
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261022T210000
UID:evt-objfCCma5vbbQ4f@events.lu.ma
DESCRIPTION:Address:\nMACEL Studios\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nRead the Runw
 ay is a new series of conversations that brings people together to screen 
 and discuss seminal collections.\nJoin us at our first screening to watch 
 and discuss Anna Sui's Spring/Summer 1994 collection. A defining moment in
  90s fashion\, the show remains an enduring example of whimsy\, femininity
  and play in ready-to-wear.\nCome ready to dissect your favourite looks\, 
 trace their relevance from 1994 to today\, and take notes on Sui's creativ
 e approach.\nSee you there!\n\nHosted by Fashion Book Club
LOCATION:MACEL Studios\, 658 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6J 1E5\, Canada
URL:https://luma.com/n1wfodty
X-SOURCE:Luma Toronto Discover
END:VEVENT
