DESCRIPTION:This cross-disciplinary symposium will feature papers on Victo
 rian notions of scientific “authority”\; collecting Pre-Raphaelite art
 \; academic integrity and cheating scandals\; national imaginaries\; evolu
 tion theory and imperialism\; and the politics of medical diagnoses. For 1
 8 years\, the Victorian Studies Network at York has been linking researche
 rs and enhancing personal and professional connections. Faculty\, post-doc
 s\, and graduate students from all departments are invited to attend. Lunc
 h and refreshments will be served.\n
