DESCRIPTION:The Writing Centre and New College are running a 2-hour Propos
 al Writing workshop designed to help clarify the process and help you make
  progress. Writing proposals at the Graduate-Level carries with it a whole
  array of expectations that are often unclear. This workshop is designed t
 o clarify some of what those expectations entail\, and to help you develop
  strategies to better navigate the demands of proposal writing to set you 
 up well for your longer-form projects. A one-to-one appointment with the W
 riting Centre graduate writing specialist (at a time of your choosing) is 
 included so that you’ll also receive targeted and detailed feedback on y
 our draft.\nRegistration is required.  Register Now!\n
