UID:6a989a8d2dac6e003723a81b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Chef Yumiko leads a hands-on workshop to make the popular Asia
 n beverage\, Brown Sugar Milk with Boba.  Participants will learn to prepa
 re and use the classic ingredients​ including milk\, molasses and tapioc
 a pearls to make this visually pleasing and sweet drink. Chef Yumiko will 
 also provide a brief history of Boba and why it's so popular globally.\n(*
 contains dairy\, sugar\, and caffeine)\nSnacks and refreshments are provid
 ed for all participants. Ingredient lists will be available at the progra
 m. Please disclose any food allergies upon registration.\nThis program is 
 part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teens afte
 r school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always available. Fr
 ee\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\nYouth 
