SUMMARY:After School Club: Plus-Plus
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261023T170000
UID:6aad91f63dd190003e72f25d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come to our After Sc
 hool Club to learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other kids\, and have fu
 n! For\nages 6 to 8 years.\nFriday\, October 2nd\n-\nTree Candidate Button
  & Poster Making\n: Prepare buttons and flyers for the upcoming Tree Candi
 date Election 2026!\nFriday\, October 9th\n-\nDash/Sphero Coding\n: Learn 
 simple programming to move robots and accomplish a task\n.\nFriday\, Octob
 er 16th\n-\nPaper Frog\n: Make an easy paper frog and bring it home.\nFrid
 ay\, October 23rd\n-\nPlus-Plus\n: Plus-Plus is a fun\, simple creative to
 y that stimulates fine motor skills\, creativity\, focus and patience.\nFr
 iday\, October 30th\n-\nArt & Craft Activity\nby the\nAga Khan Museum\n: T
 he Museum will present a workshop to celebrate Islamic Heritage Month.\nSn
 acks are offered during the After School Club for participants. Ingredient
  lists will be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by d
 onors.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information on this f
 orm is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Libraries 
 Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will only be use
 d for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions 
 about how the library handles your information can be directed to Answerli
 ne staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toron
 to\, ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Small Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aad91f63dd190003e72f25d
