SUMMARY:Halloween in the Village
DESCRIPTION:🎃 Bloor West Village Halloween Fest returns this October! 👻\n🗓️ Sat\, October 24 | 11 AM – 3 PM\n📍 Start Here – BIA Tent at St. Olave’s Church\, 360 Windermere Ave. & Bloor St W \n(Collect your Halloween Tote Bag*\, & Event Activity Map) \nVillage-Wide FREE Family Activities:\n• Trick-or-Treat* Trail with 50 + businesses | 11 AM – 1 PM\n• Village-Wide Scavenger Hunt & chance to WIN 1 of 10 $20 gift cards\n• Pumpkin Giveaway*\, courtesy of Gillian Ritchie Red Square Team (RLP)\n• Professional Photo on a Fall Backdrop\n• Kids Crafts*\, courtesy of Denova Group (Dominion Lending)\n• Dog costume swap & gently used pet toys for donation\n• Costumed Characters\, Games\, Music\n• Seasonal Food\, Drink\, Shopping Promotions & In-Store Experiences\n• Guided Fall Leaves Walking Tour | 9 AM – 11 AM \n(*while supplies last) \n🔴 Note – Trick or Treating will happen only for 2 hours from 11 AM – 1 PM\, while other activities will take place until 3 PM. 🔴 \nThank you to our Sponsors and Community Partners –\nGillian Ritchie Red Square Team (Royal Le Page)\, Denova Group Dominion Lending Centres National Ltd.\, Meridian Credit Union\, Doggieland\, St. Olave’s Church\, The Creative Nest\, 4 Cats Art Studio\, Treat Accessibly\, Turner & Porter\, Village Holdings Corporation\, D&D Party Rentals\, Terra Elysium.
