 farm where the animals are acting\nvery\nstrangely. Can a good magic spell
  save the day? Come in costume if you can. Spooky craft after the show.\nN
 o registration. Drop-in program but space is limited in the downstairs Pro
 gram Room so the room opens at 5:30pm.\nAccessibility\nLive or automated c
 losed captioning\, sign language interpretation\, intervenor services\, or
  attendant services are available upon request. Please submit your request
  at least 2 weeks in advance to: tpl.ca/accessibility-events. ​​
