SUMMARY:Google Docs 1: Create and Edit a File
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261026T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261026T200000
UID:6ac9214ca85a2c00337e56e5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn how Google Docs can be a useful free tool when you don't
  have access to Microsoft Word. In this introductory class you will learn 
 how to open\, create\, save and delete Google Docs. Features such as highl
 ight\, bold\, italics\, underline\, font colour and font size will be cove
 red as well as how to use spell check\, print\, and download as Word docum
 ent.\nPrerequisites: Basic mouse and keyboard skills are required.\nFormat
 : Hands-on with demonstrations
LOCATION:Albion\, Learning Center
