SUMMARY:3D Design with Tinkercad for Seniors
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T150000
UID:6ab3e5a308693b0f7373f992@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:TinkerCAD is browser-based software that can be used by design
 ers of all ages. In this class we will explore how to go from simple shape
 s to complex 3D designs.\nThis class is intended for adults. Computers wil
 l be provided.\nFor more information about this program please contact dih
 online@tpl.ca.\nToronto Public Library is committed to accessibility. Plea
 se call or email us if you are Deaf or have a disability and would like to
  request accommodation to participate in this program. Please let us know 
 as far in advance as possible and we will do our best to meet your request
 . At least three weeks' notice is preferred. Phone 416-393-7099 or email a
 ccessibleservices@tpl.ca.
LOCATION:Parkdale\, Auditorium(Basement)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab3e5a308693b0f7373f992
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
