UID:6ab2fb5219094f0c69394db9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For years\, rumors of the “Marsh Girl” haunted Barkley Cov
 e\, a quiet fishing village. Kya Clark is barefoot and wild\; unfit for po
 lite society. So in late 1969\, when the popular Chase Andrews is found de
 ad\, locals immediately suspect her.\nJoin us for a chat about the book Wh
 ere the Crawdads Sing by Delia Owens\nThis is a registered program\, you c
 an register online and pick up a copy of the book in branch.
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab2fb5219094f0c69394db9
