DESCRIPTION:Looking for a fun way to take a break\, get into the Halloween
  spirit\, and meet new friends? Join us for Let’s Get Spooky! 🎃\nDesi
 gned especially for first-year LA&PS students\, this festive drop-in event
  is the perfect place to connect with classmates\, unwind from your studie
 s\, and enjoy an afternoon of spooky fun. Put your problem-solving skills 
 to the test in our Halloween-themed escape room\, explore interactive game
 s and challenges\, get creative with hands-on crafts\, strike a pose at ou
 r photo booth\, and take part in a scavenger hunt full of surprises. You
 ’ll also find board games\, cozy Halloween vibes\, and plenty of opportu
 nities to relax and socialize.\nAnd of course\, no Halloween celebration w
 ould be complete without free pizza\, treats\, and festive snacks!\nWhethe
 r you stay for the whole event or just stop by between classes\, there’s
  something for everyone. Come dressed in your Halloween spirit\, bring you
 r friends\, and make some new ones along the way.\nWe can’t wait to cele
 brate with you! 👻🍬\nRegister Now\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260804
LOCATION:152 Founders Assembly Hall\, Founders College
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/laps-get-spooky-612-686/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
