UID:6ab17d27ab7a8e0037c36757@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Please join us on Tuesday\, October 27\, to discuss our book o
 f the month\,\nBrother\n\,\nby David Chariandy\, winner of the\n2017 Roger
 s Writers' Trust Fiction Prize. This\nintensely beautiful\, powerful nov
 el explores questions of masculinity\, family\, race\, and identity as the
 y are played out in a Scarborough housing complex during the sweltering he
 at and simmering violence of the summer of 1991.\nGet a copy at the first-
 floor circulation desk at Maria A. Shchuka Library while supplies last\, 
 or place a hold on the book with your library card. Ask staff how to acce
 ss eBooks and eAudiobooks.\nDrop-in\, registration not required.\nFor more
  information\, please contact Maria A. Shchuka Library at 416-394-1000.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, First floor
