BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Preschool": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9fcd23dd190003e724a05"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_preschool
SUMMARY:Maison des bébés
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T113000
UID:6aa9fcd23dd190003e724a05@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Un programme spécialement conçu pour les bébés de 0 à 18 
 mois et leurs accompagnateurs.\nChanter des chansons et des comptines à v
 otre bébé favorise le développement du langage tout en partageant un mo
 ment amusant et chaleureux.\nLes comptines avec gestes encouragent égalem
 ent les tout‑petits à bouger et à explorer selon leur stade de dévelo
 ppement.\nCe programme est offert en partenariat avec le\nCentre francopho
 ne du Grand Toronto.\nAccessibilité:\nLe sous-titrage en direct ou automa
 tique\, l’interprétation en langue des signes\, les services\nd’inter
 venant\, ou les services d’accompagnement sont disponibles sur demande. 
 Veuillez\nsoumettre votre demande au moins deux semaines à l’avance à 
 : tpl.ca/accessibility-events\nA program specially designed for babies age
 d 0 to 18 months and their caregivers.\nSinging songs and rhymes to your b
 aby helps support language development while sharing a fun and warm moment
  together.\nAction rhymes also encourage little ones to move and explore a
 ccording to their developmental stage.\nThis program is offered in partner
 ship with the\nCentre francophone du Grand Toronto.
LOCATION:Danforth/Coxwell
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9fcd23dd190003e724a05
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Teens": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aa9d8e68cf597003f94252d"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_teens
SUMMARY:Sewing Basics
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261029T120000
UID:6aa9d8e68cf597003f94252d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Want to learn to sew or would like a refresher on how to use a
  sewing machine? Our intro to sewing course will cover the basics of threa
 ding the machine\, basic stitches and more. We will be creating a small po
 uch. All materials will be provided.\nChildren under 13 must be accompanie
 d by an adult.\nRegistration is required for this class and begins Septemb
 er 15\, 2026 at 12:30 pm.\nNote: Your spot will not be guaranteed after 5 
 minutes of the start of the program.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe 
 personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Libra
 ry under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). Th
 e information will only be used for event and program registration\, deliv
 ery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your informati
 on can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5
