DESCRIPTION:Welcome to the Bloor Gladstone Book Club where we discuss book
 s in a fun and friendly atmosphere. New members are most welcome! A limite
 d number of copies are available for pick up at the first floor desk.\nOur
  titles for 2026 are:\nOctober:\nThe Wife's Tale\nby Aida Edemariam\nNovem
 ber:\nRun Towards the Danger: Confrontations With a Body of Memory\nby Sar
 ah Polley
