UID:event_316441939@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261010T053421Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261030T213000
SUMMARY:HALLOWEEN SPECIAL EVENT Casual Board Games + Prizes\, Social After
DESCRIPTION:Board Games and Social\nJoin us for a frightfully fun night of
  board games!\n\n👻 **Spooky games all night:** a hand-picked lineup of 
 Halloween-themed board games\n\n🏆 **Costume contest:** come dressed to 
 impress! Prizes for the TOP 3 costumes\, and you decide the winners\n\n
 🍬 **Halloween candy:** treats for everyone (no tricks\, we promise)\nGr
 ab your costume\, bring your game face\, and get ready for a scary good ti
 me!\n\nThe Board Games event is a fun\, sociable and charitable event\n\nW
 e are a fun\, friendly and kind group of people mostly in our 20s\, 30s an
 d 40s. Beginners are welcome! We are a very inclusive and social group and
  we teach people how to play games they have not played before :)\n\nWe pr
 ovide a variety of 40+ board games. The games usually take 5 or 10 minutes
  to learn and 30 to 60 minutes to play.\n\nPlay in French: On the last Fri
 day of the month\, we're offering a table where the games are played in Fr
 ench. Anyone with an intermediate level of French who wants to practice wh
 ile playing is welcome to join. Just ask for Philippe when you arrive.\n\n
 **Time**\n\n\\*Board Games Start time: 630pm\n\n* Board Games end time: 10
 pm\n\\*Eat / Drink/ Socialise at a nearby pub afterwards\n\n**Location**\n
 \n30 Leeds St\, Toronto\, ON M6G 3R8 (Ukrainian Catholic Church of the Hol
 y Protection)\n\nThe entrance to the board game room is at the back of the
  Church. There is a sign on the door that says BOARD GAMES GROUP.\n\nPleas
 e use the map provided on the event page also.\n\nPayment\n**There are two
  ways to pay**\n**10 by Cash - coins are not accepted. Only bills.**\\*\\*
 \n\\*\\*11.55 by Debit/Credit card\n\n**Charity Donations**\n\n* This is a
  not-for-profit initiative. Revenue go towards covering costs of the event
  including venue\, insurance marketing\, refreshments and board games. Any
  surplus revenue is donated to charity\n\n**Food and drink**\n\n\\*Everyon
 e will get cookies/candy for free\n\n* Cups will be provided for tap water
 \n\\*Bring your own food and drink.\n* Please do not bring CHIPS AND CRACK
 ERS as they make a mess and are greasy\n\\***ALCOHOL IS PROHIBITED AND WE 
 HAVE A ZERO TOLERANCE POLICY ON THIS - there are no second chances**\n\nPh
 otos will be taken at the event and posted publicly for marketing purposes
 . Please tell me when you arrive that you do not want to be in any photos\
 n\nThe event is officially hosted by Ace of Math Learning Program Ontario 
 Inc.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/boardgamestoronto/events/316441939/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260906T115733Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260906T115733Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
