DESCRIPTION:TRICK OR TREAT PT. 3 The Toronto Kiki Ballroom Alliance invite
 s you to step into a night where the spooky meets the spectacular. This Ha
 lloween\, we’re bringing you TRICK OR TREAT PT. 3 — an evening of imag
 ination\, performance\, fashion\, fantasy\, and pure Kiki excellence. TRIC
 K OR TREAT DJ Legendary Father Pleasure Juicy Couture Maven Telfar: COHEN 
 COMMENTATORS Legendary OA Father Bam Bam Siriano Prince Odi Pinklady CATEG
 ORIES * Virgin/Beginners Performance * Virgin/Beginners Runway * Face — 
 without a mask * Best Dressed * Realness * Performance * Bizarre * Runway 
 * Sex Siren * Body * Com vs. Com * First Time in Drag * The Art of Selling
  IT — with a mask * Best Costume * $1000 Team Performance Rumble ⭐️T
