CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260929
DESCRIPTION:Jump into our Fundamentals of Canva for Mature & Transfer Stud
 ents session where you’ll pick up simple tricks to make eye-catching vis
 uals without hassle. \nDuring this interactive meetup\, you’ll dig into
  the main functions of graphic design tool Canva – including ready-made 
 layouts\, plus creative options. Zero background required\, just hop on\, 
 get the hang of it\, then start designing with ease! \nDate: Monday Novem
