SUMMARY:Horror at Home: Fear in Familiar Places - Panel Discussion with Ad
 riana Chartrand\, Trynne Delaney\, Andrew F. Sullivan and Michelle Tang
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261102T193000
UID:6aa33c973dd190003e711da1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a celebration of spooky season with this haunting 
 horror panel comprised of authors Adriana Chartrand (An Ordinary Violence)
 \, Trynne Delaney (A House Unsettled)\, Andrew F. Sullivan (The Marigold) 
 and Michelle Tang (She Waits Where Shadows Gather). The panel will discuss
  the terrors of the home in their respective novels as well as other genre
  themes\, trends and more. Discussion as well as question period will be m
 oderated by Chris Krawczyk\, owner of local horror bookstore Little Ghosts
  Books.
LOCATION:Toronto Reference Library\, Beeton Hall (first floor)
