 ogram for children ages 5 and under and their parents or caregivers. Famil
 y Time runs from 10:30am  to 11:00am. Children\, parents and caregivers a
 re invited to Stay and Play\, from 11:00am to 11:30am.\n*\nTuesday\, Nove
 mber 3\nwill be a special event with a Toronto Public Health nurse visi
 ting to talk and answer any questions you may have regarding newborn care 
 from sleeping to eating. The usual storytime will not take place on this d
 ate.*\nDrop in.
