DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261103T193000
UID:6ac508b69abb62002c6c977e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This session will help participants create stronger\, more com
 petitive resumes by learning the key components of an effective resume and
  strategies for standing out to employers. Participants will explore diffe
 rent resume formats and when to use them\, learn how to tailor resume cont
 ent to highlight their strengths\, and gain an understanding of applicant 
 tracking systems (ATS) and other hiring technologies.\nThe session will al
 so cover common resume mistakes and practical ways to correct them\, ensur
 ing participants can present their skills and experience in the most effec
 tive way possible.
LOCATION:Malvern
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac508b69abb62002c6c977e
