DESCRIPTION:Join this casual painting session and create your own masterpi
 ece!\nTheme: Poppies\nSupplies will be provided\, including canvas boards\
 , acrylic paints and brushes.\nPlease note that this is not an art class. 
 Participants will paint by watching and following a step-by-step tutorial 
 video together.\nRegistration is required. Please register online. Visit o
 r call the branch if you need help with registering.
