DTEND:20261106T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20260917T185700Z
UID:MEC-b464d8ccff7bf47688f59c0fc4403b5b@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261106T000000Z
SEQUENCE:42
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 09/c2.jpg
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp\; Design
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260917
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nIn its 24th year\, CineSiege is an annual showcase scree
 ning of outstanding productions created in the previous year by undergradu
 ate students in the Department of Film and Media Arts at York University (
  https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-film-and-media-arts/ ). CineSiege fea
 tures a juried selection of short films\, chosen by industry leaders in Ca
 nadian film and media.\nWe hope you can join us to celebrate the next gene
 ration of filmmakers! All nominated films in 3rd and 4th year are also el
 igible for craft awards i.e. Best Cinematography\, Best Sound Design\, etc
 .\nCineSiege 2026\nThursday\, November 5\, 2026\n7:00 PM – 10:30 PM\n(Pl
 ease arrive at 6:30 PM\, as the show will start promptly at 7:00 PM)\nHot 
 Docs Ted Rogers Cinema: 506 Bloor St W\, Toronto\, ON M5S 1Y3\nFREE Admiss
 ion \nTICKETS \nThis event is made possible with the continued support of
  our founding sponsor\, Cinespace Studios ( https://cinespace.com/cinespac
 e-toronto/ ).\n\n \n\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924
LOCATION:Hot Docs Ted Rogers Cinema @ 506 Bloor St. West\, Toronto
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/cinesiege-2026/
