 -in-person-registration-required-tickets-1967745236974?aff=oddtdtcreator )
 .\nThis event is not being held in the main FGS office. Registration is re
 quired for event location info. While you are welcome to drop in at any po
 int during the session\, attendees will be seen on a first-come-first-serv
 e basis. When you arrive\, please add your name to the sign in sheet\, and
  we will see participants one-by-one. We cannot guarantee a specific meeti
 ng time. If you are interested in a (timed) 1:1 online appointment ( https
 ://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/ONLINEProspectiveGraduateStudentMeeting@y
 uoffice.yorku.ca/?ismsaljsauthenabled ) (linked) \, we offer those as well
 .\nPLEASE NOTE: During these sessions we will not be able to answer any qu
 estions about Schulich School of Business programs\, the Graduate Diploma 
 in Professional Accounting\, or Osgoode Law School Professional LLM progra
 ms (either Part Time\, or Full Time).\nFor all other questions about gradu
 ate diplomas\, master’s programs\, and doctoral degrees\, we look forwar
 d to having you attend.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at futures
 tudents.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/gradu
 ate/programs )\nFor any questions\, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA.\
 n
