 dergraduate students who want to build confidence\, expand their professio
 nal networks and prepare for success in the Canadian job market.\nHear fro
 m employers about how you can prepare for the rapidly changing hiring land
 scape\, practice your networking with alumni over lunch and connect with p
 rofessionally-minded international student peers.\nLook forward to:\n\nInt
 eractive workshops\nAlumni networking opportunities\nEmployer panelist ins
 ights\nProfessional headshots for all student attendees\n\nThe cost to par
 ticipate at this event is $15.00 per student. \nLearn More & Register [ic
 on name=”chevron-right” class=”small pl-2″]\n \n
