DESCRIPTION:Join us once a month on a Tuesday\, at the Malvern Library fo
 r our Seniors Social.\nEnjoy trivia\, bingo\, coffee and relaxed conversat
 ion in a welcoming and friendly space. Discover library resources and prog
 rams\, connect with community services and meet new people.\nCome socializ
 e\, learn something new\, and have fun!\nRegistration required.\nUpcoming 
 Dates (Tuesday):\nSept 8\, 2026\nOct 13\, 2026\nNov 10\, 2026\nDec 8\, 202
 6
