DESCRIPTION:Peer-Assisted Study Session (PASS) Leader: Natalie\nThis Peer-
 assisted Study Session (PASS) is for : Applied Calculus I Fall 2026.\nPart
 icipate in weekly\, collaborative study sessions led by a peer who has suc
 cessfully completed the course. Review key concepts\, ask questions and di
 scover effective strategies to boost your confidence and academic success.
 \nPlease Note: Any schedule changes or session cancellations will be commu
 nicated through eClass. Students are encouraged to check eClass regularly 
 for the most up-to-date information. During Fall Reading Week\, Peer-Assis
 ted Study Sessions\, Tutoring\, and Office Hours are typically not offered
 . If a session is scheduled during this period\, details will be communica
 ted by the course instructor and posted in eClass.\nLearn more about PASS 
 ( https://students.yorku.ca/PASS ).\n
