DESCRIPTION:Online workshop 10 November\, 2026\, 3:00-4:30 pm ET\nThis wor
 kshop can count towards the Teaching Commons’ Certificates in AI Pedagog
 ies. Learn more at our website: https://www.yorku.ca/teachingcommons/cert
 ificates/#AIPedagogies\nIn this workshop we critically examine the materia
 l\, environmental\, and infrastructural dimensions of AI (e.g.\, energy co
 nsumption\, data storage\, hardware demands)\, and what this means for res
 ponsible pedagogy in a climate-conscious academy.\nVisit YULearn to regist
 er: https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=214
 3 ( https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?id=214
 3 )\n
