  When his evil nemesis Colonel Steven J. Lockjaw resurfaces after 16 years
 \, they must face Bob's past and run for the future.\nRated 14A. 2hr 42min
 s.\nEnglish Subtitles for the Deaf and Hard of Hearing (SDH) when availabl
