SUMMARY:Recovery College: YU & Balance Week 4 | Algorithms & AI literacy: 
 Supporting your digital footprint
DTSTART:20261112T170000Z
DTEND:20261112T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260918T190200Z
UID:MEC-2c61f304e5c71379e0af1cd15197a96e@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261112T170000Z
SEQUENCE:4
CATEGORIES:Academic Advising &amp\; Student Success,Advising,Bethune Colle
 ge,Calumet College,Colleges,Faculties,Faculty of Education,Faculty of Heal
 th,Faculty of Liberal Arts &amp\; Professional Studies,Faculty of Science,
 Glendon,Health Education &amp\; Promotion,LA&amp\;PS Colleges,LA&amp\;PS F
 ounders College,LA&amp\;PS McLaughlin College,LA&amp\;PS New College,LA&am
 p\;PS Vanier College,Lassonde School of Engineering,Learning Commons,Learn
 ing Skills Services,Markham Campus,Markham Student Accessibility Services,
 School of Continuing Studies,School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp\;
  Design,Stong College,Student Accessibility Services,Student Counselling, 
 Health &amp\; Well-being,Student Leaders at Markham (SLAM),Student Life,St
 udents,the Atkinson Centre for Mature and Part-time Students,Well-being
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260918
DESCRIPTION:This session will be offered in person at York University’s 
 Markham Campus and is open to students from all York University campuses.\
 nHave you ever googled yourself? Or maybe an old friend from high school? 
 Once something is shared online\, it becomes easily findable with just one
  search.\nIn this week’s session of YU & Balance\, participants will:\n\
 nGet a better grasp on what digital footprint is\nHow to find reliable sou
 rces of information\nUnderstand algorithms\, social media feeds and strate
 gize on how to mindfully engage AI\n\nThis session is part of a 6-week Rec
 overy College series. For each session attended\, participants will receiv
 e $5 on their YU-card. To receive the gift card\, you must attend the full
  session (approximately 45–60 minutes). Unfortunately\, we’re not able
  to provide gift cards for partial attendance. Gift cards will be emailed 
 after the session to the same email address used to register and join the 
 session.\nSpace is limited\, and registration is offered on a first-come\,
  first-served basis. If the session is full and you’d like to be added t
 o the waitlist\, please email hstacey@yorku.ca ( mailto:hstacey@yorku.ca )
 . We’ll reach out if a spot becomes available. If you’re registered bu
 t can no longer attend\, please let us know as soon as you can so we can o
 ffer your spot to another student.\nRegister for Algorithms & AI literacy:
  Supporting your digital footprint ( https://forms.students.yorku.ca/view.
 php?id=500072 )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001
LOCATION:Markham Campus (MK2050)
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
