 p\; Applied Linguistics,Graduate Program in Management Practice,Graduate P
 rogram in Mathematics &amp\; Statistics,Graduate Program in Mechanical Eng
 ineering,Graduate Program in Music,Graduate Program in Nursing,Graduate Pr
 ogram in Philosophy,Graduate Program in Physics &amp\; Astronomy,Graduate 
 Program in Political Science,Graduate Program in Psychology,Graduate Progr
 am in Public Policy, Administration and Law,Graduate Program in Science &a
 mp\; Technology Studies,Graduate Program in Social &amp\; Political Though
 t,Graduate Program in Social Anthrolology,Graduate Program in Social Work,
 Graduate Program in Socio-Legal Studies,Graduate Program in Sociology,Grad
 uate Program in Theatre,Graduate Program in Theatre, Dance &amp\; Performa
 nce Studies,Graduate Program in Translation Studies,Graduate Program in Vi
 sual Art
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260817
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a Graduate Admissions 1:1 Drop In
  Session\, in person!\nJoin us to ask any questions that you might have ab
 out York University and our graduate admissions process.\nRegistration is 
 required ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/11-sessions-for-graduate-admissions
 -in-person-registration-required-tickets-1967745236974?aff=oddtdtcreator )
 .\nThis event is not being held in the main FGS office. Registration is re
 quired for event location info.\nWhile you are welcome to drop in at any p
 oint during the session\, attendees will be seen on a first-come-first-ser
 ve basis. When you arrive\, please add your name to the sign in sheet\, an
 d we will see participants one-by-one. We cannot guarantee a specific meet
 ing time. If you are interested in a (timed) 1:1 online appointment ( http
 s://bookings.cloud.microsoft/book/ONLINEProspectiveGraduateStudentMeeting@
 yuoffice.yorku.ca/?ismsaljsauthenabled ) (linked) \, we offer those as wel
 l.\nPLEASE NOTE: During these sessions we will not be able to answer any q
 uestions about Schulich School of Business programs\, the Graduate Diploma
  in Professional Accounting\, or Osgoode Law School Professional LLM progr
 ams (either Part Time\, or Full Time).\nFor all other questions about grad
 uate diplomas\, master’s programs\, and doctoral degrees\, we look forwa
 rd to having you attend.\nLearn more about our graduate programs at future
 students.yorku.ca/graduate/programs  ( http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/grad
 uate/programs )\nFor any questions\, please email us at FGSAPPLY@YORKU.CA.
 \n
