DESCRIPTION:Learn how to crochet simple hearts. Create hearts of various c
 olors\, can be given as gifts for friends and family. All instructions\, c
 rochet tools and materials will be provided.\nThree walk in tickets will b
 e available 30mins before the event starts.\nIf you are no longer able to 
 attend\, we kindly ask that you cancel your registration as soon as possib
 le to allow someone else the opportunity to participate.
LOCATION:Queen/Saulter
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac90f11295b3b0033cb0e92
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
