 chool of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp\; Design,the Atkinson Centre fo
 r Mature and Part-time Students
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260929
DESCRIPTION:In this workshop\, you will learn to use Googles Notebook LM t
 o build a study system that maximizes your limited time by transforming eb
 ooks\, digital notes and other sources into a personalized knowledge base.
  \nWe will cover how to generate custom study aids including: podcasts\, 
 mind maps\, reports and others. You’ll also discover how to balance a bu
 sy schedule with efficient active-learning tools like AI-generated practic
 e quizzes\, flashcards and a Socratic tutor that simplifies complex academ
 ic topics. \nDate: Thursday November 17th\, 2026 \nTime: 1:00pm – 2:00
 pm \nLocation: Zoom  \nRegister here: https://yorku.zoom.us/meeting/reg
 ister/GCAjMJRiRLaLOiEIgiTKvg \n
