DESCRIPTION:Join us on the 3rd Tuesday evening of every month to discuss b
 ooks in a friendly and social atmosphere.\nOctober Book Title:\nHarry Pott
 er and the Philosopher's Stone\nby\nJ.K. Rowling\nNovember Book Title:\nAl
 ias Grace\nby Margaret Atwood\nTo get a copy of the book\, please visit th
 e 1st floor desk at Albert Campbell Library. New members are always welcom
