SUMMARY:Impacts and Effects of Microaggressions in the PSE Environment (Mi
 croagressions in PSE)
DTSTART:20261120T150000Z
DTEND:20261120T163000Z
DTSTAMP:20260923T184100Z
UID:MEC-cf37368a5897a76478650a7eea56cfc1@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261120T150000Z
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Equity, Diversity &amp\; Inclusion,Equity, People &amp\; Cultur
 e
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260923
DESCRIPTION:This session will highlight the reality and pervasiveness of m
 icroaggressions within the context of post-secondary institutions. We will
  look at how and why microaggressions are harmful\, discuss some tools to 
 address and inhibit microaggressions\, and offer opportunities to practice
  using these tools in order to foster a more inclusive and equitable campu
 s environment. This session will focus specifically on the actions of indi
 viduals and groups in fostering inclusion and belonging.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923
LOCATION:https://yulearn.yorku.ca/local/yulearn/learning_opportunity.php?i
 d=1396
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/impacts-and-effects-of-microaggressions
 -in-the-pse-environment-microagressions-in-pse/
