SUMMARY:MDEM & DEM PhD Information Session # 4
DTSTART:20261120T170000Z
DTEND:20261120T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260610T154400Z
UID:MEC-0caa694ffbe5d4bc7a4f359989388fdb@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261120T170000Z
SEQUENCE:2
CATEGORIES:Graduate Program in Disaster &amp\; Emergency Management
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260610
DESCRIPTION:Master of Disaster & Emergency Management (MDEM)\, Doctor of P
 hilosophy (PhD)\nYork University offers leading graduate programs in Disas
 ter & Emergency Management. Its Masters degree (MDEM) is the only such pro
 gram offered in Ontario\, and one of just two in Canada. It’s newly esta
 blished PhD in Disaster & Emergency Management is the first such program i
 n the entire country. In this exciting and rapidly expanding field you wil
 l explore key concepts\, methodologies and technologies used by emergency 
 management professionals while honing your analytical\, research and criti
 cal thinking skills. Both the Master’s and Doctoral program are offered 
 on a full-time or part-time basis\, and prepare you to synthesize large am
 ounts of complex information and make sound decisions in challenging and o
 ften difficult circumstances.\nRegister here for zoom link : https://yorku
 .zoom.us/meeting/register/uQYKddJHTI2J2VD11F2pnQ\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260610
LOCATION:Virtual (Zoom)
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/mdem-dem-phd-information-session-4/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
