 ng a screenplay  can be tricky as the industry has strict rules on how the
 y are formatted.This workshop will guide participants on how to properly f
 ormat a screenplay and the different software available to make this proce
 ss easier.\nComputers will be provided for this program.\nInformation Coll
 ection Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the 
