 iet beauty of snow-covered fields\, frosted trees\, and soft winter light.
  Learn a variety of painting techniques and create your very own painting 
 which captures the coolness of a snowy day.\nAll materials will be provide
 d\, and no previous painting experience is required.\nFor younger adults a
 ges 18 to 24.
