SUMMARY:Theatre at York presents Casimir and Caroline
DTSTART:20261122T003000Z
DTEND:20261130T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20260924T190400Z
UID:MEC-6f31b4d25c2e143714d8f7d78bde7deb@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261122T003000Z
SEQUENCE:7
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 09/1.jpg
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp\; Design
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260924
DESCRIPTION:Casimir and Caroline by Ödon von Horváth ( https://en.wikipe
 dia.org/wiki/%C3%96d%C3%B6n_von_Horv%C3%A1th ) – Adapted by Paolo Santal
 ucia\, Holgar Syme with The Howland Co. From an original translation by Ho
 lgar Syme\nCasimir and Caroline is a play about love in the cold atmospher
 e of modern capitalism. We follow these ultra star-crossed lovers\, as the
 y navigate clingy co-workers\, sketchy best friends\, questionable HR repr
 esentatives\, the playboy boss\, that powerhouse from the Montreal office 
 and those beautiful few who might actually possess an ounce of wisdom. The
 y all desperately long for something more. None of them can say what that 
 might be. But at least their lives look good on Instagram.\nPerformance Sc
 hedule:\nSaturday\, November 21 – 7:30pm (Preview)\nSunday\, November 22
  – 7:30pm (Preview)\nTuesday\, November 24 – 7:30pm\nWednesday\, Novem
 ber 25 – 7:30pm\nThursday\, November 26 – 7:30pm\nFriday\, November 27
  – 7:30pm\nSaturday\, November 28 – 2:00pm | 7:30pm\nLocation: Joseph
  G. Green Theatre\nTickets ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/yorku/online/index
 .asp ): \nPreview Tickets (Nov 21 & 22): $ 15.00 | Student: $ 15.00\nAdva
 nced (until Sunday Nov 22): $ 20.00\nRegular Tickets: $ 25.00\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/theatre-at-york-casimir-and-caroline/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
