SUMMARY:Coffee and Conversation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T110000
UID:6a7cf0ea4c610f0038949e09@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some light refreshments\, and informal discussion about 
 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we will be joined by a different 
 community organization. For this November event we are welcoming staff fro
 m the\nMalvern Family Resource Centre\nto introduce themselves and the fre
 e services they offer to individuals and families in our community.\nSnac
 ks and refreshments are provided for all participants. Ingredient lists wi
 ll be available at the program.
LOCATION:Malvern\, New Programming Space
