SUMMARY:Starting To Execute Your Side Hustle!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T190000
UID:6a9ae88d57c264087ad63909@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This workshop is for individuals who know that having one inco
 me is not enough\, for those who have been thinking about starting a side
  hustle but haven’t yet\, and for those who are in the ‘planning phase
 ' of their side hustle…\nDuring this interactive workshop\, participants
  will work on ways to find clarity on what they want to do and how they ca
 n start implementing their idea. It will include a hands-on experiment for
  participants to start taking action in order to get visible and to build 
 momentum.\nBring your enthusiasm!  Q&A included.\nAll young adults are wel
 come!\nThis workshop is hosted by Rushauna Beckles.
LOCATION:Morningside\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a9ae88d57c264087ad63909
