UID:69a098a32866a5b4883e9185@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Every Wednesday come out to build\, create and use your imagin
 ation with LEGO. Enjoy a new building challenge each week. Complete 5 chal
 lenges and get a sticker! Drop-in.\nLive or automated closed captioning\, 
 sign language interpretation\, intervenor services\, or attendant services
