DESCRIPTION:Workshop 8: Verb that Noun!\nAre you in the habit of disguisin
 g perfectly good verbs in those bloated drag-your-sentence-to-a-slow-and-h
 eavy-crawl nouns called nominalizations? Come to this week’s Grammar On
 ! and learn how to quicken the pulse and the pace of your sentences. Come
  learn how to verb that noun!!\nNo RSVPs. Just click to join!\n
