DESCRIPTION:All it takes is one below average or even just average mark to
  get inside your head and begin doubting yourself and your ability to succ
 eed in your program. The pressure to get high marks\, or academic perfecti
 onism\, is commonly experienced by students in university. This week\, stu
 dents will explore the effects of stress on academic performance\, learn s
 trategies for managing and coping with stress to tackle exam season. \n \
 nRegister & learn more at https://students.yorku.ca/counselling/health-edu
 cation/recovery-college\n
