SUMMARY:Mushroom Mixed Media
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T200000
UID:6ab162bfca248a0029175808@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Create illustrations of different types of mushrooms in pens o
 n mixed media backgrounds. Combine watercolours\, acrylic and collage to m
 ake layered and textured backgrounds. Learn to draw a variety of different
  species of mushrooms on these backgrounds\, adding colour\, depth and det
 ail to your art.
LOCATION:Spadina Road\, Centre of branch at Canoe Table
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab162bfca248a0029175808
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
