SUMMARY:Fraud Prevention with CPA Canada
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261130T190000
UID:6ac3e0d39abb62002c6c6737@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Yorkville Library for a presentation on fraud p
 revention from the CPA (Charted Professional Accountants of Canada). Parti
 cipants will learn the following:\nwhat fraud is and how it works\nidentif
 y the signs of fraud and how to act on suspicions\nlearn about top three s
 cams\nwhy vulnerable people are targeted\nwhat to do if you are a victim o
 f fraud
LOCATION:Yorkville
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac3e0d39abb62002c6c6737
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
