DESCRIPTION:Join us for a holiday film screening of A Christmas Carol (195
 1) The classic Dickens story about a bitter old man who's given a chance 
 for redemption when three ghosts come to visit him on Christmas Eve. VCI
  is pleased to present this holiday classic\, fully restored and re-master
 ed from the original negative discovered in England. Film Rating- G. Runt
 ime – 1 hour and 26 minutes.\nDrop in\, no registration required.
LOCATION:Mount Pleasant\, Basement program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a738449f213992f00c9cfba
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
