 services in the neighbourhood. Get to know your local library staff and le
 t us know what information and resources you would like to access at the l
 ibrary and in the community.\nEach month we may be joined by a community o
 rganization.\nSnacks and refreshments are provided for all participants. I
 ngredient lists will be available at the program.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Atrium\, Main Floor
