UID:6a34456eba0ec7dc22617fc8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively group discussion on the book of the month
 . Pick up a copy of the book from staff at the branch prior to the meeting
  or download it from the Libby app.\nThe book being discussed in September
  is\nDeath Comes to Pemberley\nby P.D. James.\nInformation Collection Noti
 ce:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Pub
 lic Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 
 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program registratio
