UID:6a90b4d8be148200298a9772@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for something to do after school? Come out to our Afte
 r School Club every Tuesday and learn new things\, make stuff\, meet other
  kids and have fun! For ages 6-12. Drop in. No registration required.\nSna
 cks are offered during the After School Club for participants. Food may co
 ntain or have come into contact with common allergens. Ingredient lists wi
 ll be available. Snacks are generously supported\, in part\, by donors.\nU
 pcoming programs:\nOctober 6 - This or That quiz with iPads + Poster craft
 \nOctober 13 - Cotton Ball Rain craft\nOctober 20 - Collage bookmarks\nOct
 ober 27 - Paper Bag Village
