DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261216T153000
UID:69fcdc91f6bd012f006661cd@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Riverdale Immigrant Women's Centre\, this worksho
 p is an introduction to long-term financial planning including retirement 
 savings and better understanding of federal income benefits\, such as\, Ca
 nada Pension Plan (CPP) and Old Age Security (OAS).\nDrop in.
LOCATION:Parliament Street
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fcdc91f6bd012f006661cd
