SUMMARY:Knit\, Crochet & Crafting Circle - evening sessions
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261228T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261228T193000
UID:6a748e6bf4e5db3d00c6d3fe@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Bring your own knit\, crochet\, or other portable craft proje
 ct\, and hang out and chat with other crafters while you work! Once a mo
 nth\, we will gather in the evening for cozy crafts to unwind after a long
  day.\nDrop ins welcome\, registration is optional but encouraged if you 
 wish to receive a reminder email.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe per
 sonal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library 
 under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The i
 nformation will only be used for event and program registration\, delivery
  and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles your information 
 can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\, 416-397-5981
 \, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, 2nd floor: \nRoom 1 (Sep 28\, Nov 30
 \, Dec 28)\; Room 2/3 (Oct 26)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a748e6bf4e5db3d00c6d3fe
