UID:69711d50992fc18a86deb1ae@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Youth Hub every Tuesday to play board games wit
 h your friends! Ask us for our list of board games\, and check our monthly
  calendar for Tournaments with prizes! All materials provided.\nThis progr
 am is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for teen
 s after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always availabl
 e. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with a\n
 Youth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Eatonville
