DESCRIPTION:Do you enjoy recipes and learning about food. Novice or chef e
 xtraordinaire\, drop in for an evening of culinary adventure.  Each month 
 we will delve into a different topic with lively and friendly  conversatio
 n.  Last year's book club created a 50-page recipe book to take home and 
 enjoy.\nDrop In. No Registration Required.  We meet at 6:30\nSept 10 \; 
 Taking in the harvest:. Storing and keeping our food through the winter\nO
 ct 1:      Thanksgiving  Recipes\nNov  5     Cooking techniques\nD
 ec 3      Holiday Favorites
